import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 788 | Transcended Ones and Institutions | The Transcended One's Relationship with the Anchor Supervisory Committee","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 788 | Transcended Ones and Institutions | The Transcended One's Relationship with the Anchor Supervisory Committee","no":788,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Institutions","Anchor Supervisory Committee","Supervision","Accountability"],"related":["49-Governance Framework and Checks-and-Balances","27-Anchor Calibration and Maintenance","784-Transcended Ones and Institutions Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0788_模块4-制度-超脱者与锚点监督委员会.md","filePath":"en/0788_模块4-制度-超脱者与锚点监督委员会.md"}`),r={name:"en/0788_模块4-制度-超脱者与锚点监督委员会.md"};function s(a,e,h,l,d,u){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-788-transcended-ones-and-institutions-the-transcended-one-s-relationship-with-the-anchor-supervisory-committee" tabindex="-1">Entry 788 | Transcended Ones and Institutions | The Transcended One&#39;s Relationship with the Anchor Supervisory Committee <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-788-transcended-ones-and-institutions-the-transcended-one-s-relationship-with-the-anchor-supervisory-committee" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 788 | Transcended Ones and Institutions | The Transcended One&#39;s Relationship with the Anchor Supervisory Committee&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 49, 27, 784</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-who-watches-the-transcended-one" tabindex="-1">Introduction: who watches the transcended one? <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-who-watches-the-transcended-one" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: who watches the transcended one?&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Anchor Supervisory Committee is the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s supervisory body — specifically watching all public-post holders, preventing power abuse. Among the four institutional bodies, it has the most direct relationship with the transcended one: <strong>the transcended one is the Supervisory Committee&#39;s primary supervision object.</strong> The old world has no such body, because the old world believed &quot;the strongest needs no supervision.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou must squarely answer: <strong>why does the strongest need supervision most?</strong> This entry pins this relationship down.</p><p>Six top-level axioms all line up: the anti-predation axiom requires supervision directly target predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires supervision right belong to Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom requires supervision serve uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom requires supervision not create causal loopholes; the law-first axiom requires the supervision mechanism be self-consistent and not bypassable by any transcended individual.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-supervisory-committee-s-four-grips-on-the-transcended-one" tabindex="-1">I. The Supervisory Committee&#39;s Four Grips on the Transcended One <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-supervisory-committee-s-four-grips-on-the-transcended-one" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Supervisory Committee&#39;s Four Grips on the Transcended One&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Anchor Supervisory Committee&#39;s supervision of the transcended one has four concrete grips:</p><ol><li><strong>Daily audit</strong>: weekly automatic audit of the transcended one&#39;s Alaya Network operation logs, checking for anomalous cross-plane operations;</li><li><strong>Quarterly weight audit</strong>: quarterly audit of the transcended one&#39;s civilizational-weight five-dimension composition; any subitem declining triggers an early warning;</li><li><strong>Annual public hearing</strong>: once a year public hearing; the transcended one must in person report post performance to Myriad-Rank representatives;</li><li><strong>Random fly-by inspection</strong>: unscheduled, unannounced fly-by inspection, checking the transcended one&#39;s actual work state.</li></ol><p>Four grips together; the transcended one is watched every day — but this watching is not &quot;suspecting he&#39;s a bad person,&quot; but &quot;ensuring his power always stays within Myriad-Rank authorization.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-why-the-strongest-needs-supervision-most" tabindex="-1">II. Why the Strongest Needs Supervision Most <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-the-strongest-needs-supervision-most" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why the Strongest Needs Supervision Most&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world believes &quot;the strong need no supervision&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s logic is the exact opposite:</p><ul><li><strong>The greater the destructive power, the greater the risk</strong>: one of the transcended one&#39;s operation errors may disturb an entire star sector. An ordinary person&#39;s error ruins at most a room; the transcended one&#39;s error ruins a galaxy. Risk is proportional to destructive power;</li><li><strong>The greater the power, the greater the corruption temptation</strong>: public computable power, cross-plane channels, and law permissions the transcended one may mobilize are trillions of times those of ordinary people. Temptation is also trillions of times;</li><li><strong>The more people worship, the easier to go astray</strong>: the transcended one, gazed up at by Myriad Ranks for long, easily develops the &quot;I am right&quot; self-hallucination. Supervision is the external brake installed on this hallucination.</li></ul><p>Three reasons together: <strong>it is not that the transcended one&#39;s character is flawed, but that the transcended one&#39;s post risk is too large.</strong> Risk large, supervision must be strict.</p><h2 id="iii-the-transcended-one-s-cooperation-obligation-to-the-supervisory-committee" tabindex="-1">III. The Transcended One&#39;s Cooperation Obligation to the Supervisory Committee <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-transcended-one-s-cooperation-obligation-to-the-supervisory-committee" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Transcended One&#39;s Cooperation Obligation to the Supervisory Committee&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one has an obligation to cooperate with the Supervisory Committee, may not refuse:</p><ul><li><strong>May not refuse audit</strong>: Alaya Network logs are fully auto-recorded; the transcended one has no right to delete, hide, or encrypt;</li><li><strong>May not refuse hearing</strong>: the transcended one must attend the annual public hearing, may not delegate another to report on his behalf;</li><li><strong>May not refuse fly-by inspection</strong>: during fly-by inspection the transcended one must open his work space, operation records, and computable-power invocation list;</li><li><strong>May not retaliate against supervisors</strong>: any retaliatory act against Supervisory Committee members triggers Symbiotic Court criminal prosecution.</li></ul><p>The cooperation obligation ensures supervision is not &quot;going through the motions,&quot; but real supervision.</p><h2 id="iv-the-supervisory-committee-s-reverse-relationship-with-the-transcended-one" tabindex="-1">IV. The Supervisory Committee&#39;s Reverse Relationship with the Transcended One <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-supervisory-committee-s-reverse-relationship-with-the-transcended-one" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Supervisory Committee&#39;s Reverse Relationship with the Transcended One&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The relationship is two-way. The transcended one cooperates with the Supervisory Committee, and the Supervisory Committee must also protect the transcended one:</p><ul><li><strong>No indiscriminate harassment</strong>: the Supervisory Committee may not frequently harass because &quot;the transcended one is strong&quot;; audit rhythm is stipulated by institutions;</li><li><strong>No leaking transcended-one privacy</strong>: audit records are only for public accountability, not for private snooping;</li><li><strong>Timely feedback</strong>: if audit finds problems, the transcended one must be promptly informed, given rectification opportunity; no &quot;reckoning after autumn.&quot;</li></ul><p>Reverse protection ensures supervision is &quot;accountability tool,&quot; not &quot;targeted-persecution tool.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the Supervisory Committee prevents transcended ones from using public computable power for private purposes; it is the &quot;auditor&quot; of computable-power use</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: daily audit directly watches cross-plane operations; predatory transcended ones have no place to hide under audit</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in the Tang-Luo system no one supervises Gu Chensha; Heng Yuan Zhou uses the Supervisory Committee to completely abolish the old precedent of &quot;the strongest is unsupervised&quot;</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the Supervisory Committee is composed of Myriad-Rank five-lineage representatives, not the transcended one&#39;s peers</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: supervision&#39;s entire procedure, standards, and audit results are opened network-wide through the Selfless Dao. The Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm transcended one is the Supervisory Committee&#39;s primary audit object</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The strongest needs supervision most. Not because his character is bad, but because his destructive power is large, temptation is large, and he easily self-deifies. The Anchor Supervisory Committee is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s external brake for this risk — the brake is not distrust of the driver, but because this car runs too fast.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/49-治理框架与权力制衡.html">Entry 49 · Governance Framework and Checks-and-Balances</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/27-锚点校准与维护.html">Entry 27 · Anchor Calibration and Maintenance</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/784_模块4-制度-总论.html">Entry 784 · Transcended Ones and Institutions Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/780_模块4-万族-超脱者的监督机制.html">Entry 780 · Transcended One&#39;s Supervision Mechanism</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',28)])])}const m=t(r,[["render",s]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
